==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|frm}} {{term|queu}}, {{term|cueue}} et al., and from Modern French {{term|queue}}. According to the famous 19th Century French linguist {{term|Cyrille}} it is a {{term|compound word}} from the French {{term|en}} and {{term|queue}}.

===Verb===
{{en-verb|enqueues|'''[[enqueuing]]''' ''or'' '''[[enqueueing]]'''|enqueued}}
#{{transitive|computing}} To add an [[item]] to a [[queue]].

